* bench_bvd: Butterworth-Van Dyke equivalent of a resonator: motional series RLC (RM, LM, CM) in parallel with the static capacitance C0.
* Used by crystals, ceramic resonators and piezo transducers. Values are set by each package (typical, not datasheet fits).
.subckt bench_bvd a b params: LM=1m CM=1p RM=10 C0=1p
R1 a n1 {RM}
L1 n1 n2 {LM}
C1 n2 b {CM}
C2 a b {C0}
.ends bench_bvd
